    "## 7. Avoiding Data Leakage\n",
    "\n",
    "The preprocessing operations must not be learned from the complete dataset\n",
    "before model evaluation.\n",
    "\n",
    "During the classification experiments, the preprocessing transformer will be\n",
    "included inside a scikit-learn `Pipeline`.\n",
    "\n",
    "For every cross-validation iteration:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. The scaler and encoder will be fitted using only the training fold.\n",
    "2. The learned transformations will then be applied to the validation fold.\n",
    "3. The classifier will be trained only using the transformed training data.\n",
    "\n",
    "This prevents information from the validation data from influencing the\n",
    "training process and therefore avoids data leakage."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8d9bfae7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Preprocessing Preview\n",
    "\n",
    "The preprocessing pipeline is temporarily fitted to the complete predictor\n",
    "matrix only to inspect the structure of the transformed data.\n",
    "\n",
    "This step is used exclusively to verify:\n",
    "\n",
    "- The dimensionality of the transformed matrix.\n",
    "- The total number of features after one-hot encoding.\n",
    "- The names of the transformed numerical and categorical features.\n",
    "\n",
    "The fitted transformer obtained in this section will not be reused during\n",
    "model evaluation."
   ]
